Description: 4k procedural graphics by Soulman, released in 2020
 Eternal Forest renders a single fullscreen picture of a forest covering
 hills, with a bird, entirely from a raymarching GLSL shader driven by a
 small GTK program. An OpenGL 4.5 capable driver is needed.
 .
 Eternal Forest was ranked 5th at Solskogen 2020 in the 4k procedural
 graphics category.
